    <ct:overview rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.</ct:overview>
